vFM Player - Synth presets

SD folder: /vFM/synth

Copy the supplied VFS launchers for Felucca, DX7 and Klattsch. Optional Yamaha DX7 bulk SYX dumps can also be placed here. Keep your own presets when updating. VFS files select an engine/preset; they are not MIDI instrument banks.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/synth

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
